Data Lead - Financial Services &nbsp;

Location: Warsaw, Poland | Practice Area: Data &amp; Analytics | Type: Permanent &nbsp;

Lead data transformation. Modernise data platforms. Deliver meaningful change for leading financial institutions. &nbsp;

The Role &nbsp;

At Capco, we partner with leading banks and financial institutions to deliver complex business and technology transformations, helping our clients modernise their data capabilities and drive meaningful business outcomes. &nbsp;

We are looking for an experienced Data Lead to join our Data &amp; Analytics practice in Warsaw. &nbsp;

In this role, you will lead data transformation, migration and modernisation initiatives for financial services clients, combining a solid understanding of modern data technologies with consulting, project delivery and stakeholder management capabilities. &nbsp;

You will work directly with clients to understand their business and technology challenges, shape data solutions and oversee delivery across complex transformation programmes. From defining data migration strategies and modernising data platforms to coordinating technical teams and managing senior stakeholders, you will play a key role in delivering successful outcomes. &nbsp;

We particularly welcome professionals who have delivered data initiatives for banking and financial services clients, whether their experience comes from consulting firms, financial institutions or technology delivery environments. &nbsp;

What You’ll Do &nbsp;

• Lead end-to-end data transformation, migration and modernisation initiatives for banking and financial services clients, including legacy platform migrations, cloud adoption and data platform transformation. &nbsp;

