• Shape and oversee modern data architectures, including data warehouses, data lakes, lakehouses, ETL/ELT pipelines, data integration and cloud-based data platforms. &nbsp;

• Coordinate data engineers, architects and cross-functional delivery teams, providing technical direction, managing dependencies and ensuring solutions meet business, quality and performance expectations. &nbsp;

• Support clients in improving data governance, data quality, data lineage and data management capabilities, ensuring data solutions are scalable, secure and aligned with financial services requirements. &nbsp;

